/Users/tiger/.codex-run/domainry-plane-opt31c-262ca059-8283/codex-home-opt70/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/67f8834a57bd5504.json:25900:        "description": "The Seismic MCP Connector for ChatGPT enables secure integration between ChatGPT and Seismic, allowing ChatGPT to generate accurate, Seismic-specific responses using approved sales and enablement content.\n\nBuilt on the Model Context Protocol (MCP), the connector provides authentication and scope-based access control, ensuring only authorized tools and content are available within ChatGPT.\n\nTo configure access, users must install the MCP Connector for ChatGPT app from Seismic Exchange, where tenant admins define scopes and permissions that control which Seismic capabilities are exposed.\n\nOnce configured:\n\nChatGPT connects to Seismic through the MCP server\n\nOnly approved tools and content are accessible\n\nResponses are grounded in trusted, compliant materials\n\nWithout proper installation and scope configuration, Seismic tools will not be visible in ChatGPT.",
