/Users/tiger/.codex-run/domainry-plane-opt31c-262ca059-8283/codex-home-opt70/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/67f8834a57bd5504.json:100243:        "description": "Tawadoo: Buy, Sell & Bid — Morocco's #1 Free Marketplace 🇲🇦\n\nExperience the future of smart shopping with Tawadoo — the ultimate free marketplace to buy, sell, and bid in Morocco. From Casablanca and Rabat to Marrakech, Agadir, Fès, and Tangier, discover thousands of local listings near you. 🎯\n\nLooking for a smarter way to shop or sell? Tawadoo puts the thrill of live auctions and the power of direct negotiation right at your fingertips — whether you're decluttering your home or hunting for that perfect find.\n\nWhy Tawadoo?\nMore than a classifieds app — Tawadoo is an integrated platform that combines the proximity of local markets with competitive auctions and an immersive, social experience built on photos and videos, ensuring transparency and trust in every transaction. 💡\n\nKey Features:\n✅ AI-Powered Listings — Our AI automatically generates compelling titles and descriptions to maximise your visibility and search ranking. 🤖\n✅ Auto-Translation — Post in French or Arabic; Tawadoo translates your listing into the buyer's language for a seamless experience. 🌍\n✅ Photos & Video — HD photos and short videos so buyers see your items from every angle. 📸\n✅ 3 Ways to Sell — Fixed price, negotiated offers, or live auctions with real-time bidding. 🤝\n✅ Analytics Dashboard — Track listing performance, views, and sales stats in real-time. 📈\n✅ Precise Geolocation — Find and sell right in your neighbourhood, from Casablanca to Agadir. 📍\n✅ Verified Profiles & Secure Messaging — A trusted community with privacy-first chat. 🔒\n\nBrowse Categories:\n🔹 Real Estate: Apartments, houses, offices\n🔹 Motors: Cars, motorcycles, spare parts\n🔹 High-Tech: Smartphones, laptops, electronics\n🔹 Fashion: Clothing, jewellery, accessories\n🔹 Home & Garden: Furniture, décor, DIY\n🔹 Services & Jobs: Job offers and professional services\n🔹 Pets: Everything for your companions\n\nTawadoo Coins: Win & Save! 💰\nBoost your experience with Tawadoo Coins. Earn by playing the Daily Lucky Wheel, rating your partners, or referring friends. Buy Coins directly in-app for an instant boost. Use them to feature listings, join auctions as a security deposit, or extend your publication limits.\n\nSecurity & Compliance 🛡️\nYour safety is our top priority. Compliant with Law 09-08 — you have the right to access, rectify, and object to the processing of your data. Authorised by the CNDP under N°A-W-1438/2025.\n🔹 Verified Profiles · Secure Messaging · Your data is never sold.\n\nHow It Works:\n1️⃣ Browse — Explore thousands of local listings across Morocco.\n2️⃣ Connect — Chat directly with sellers via secure messaging.\n3️⃣ Close — Negotiate and finalise your deal with ease.\n\nAsk Tawadoo on ChatGPT to search Morocco's marketplace, find local deals, and discover listings near you — instantly. 🚀",
