/Users/tiger/.codex-run/domainry-plane-opt31c-262ca059-8283/codex-home-opt70/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/67f8834a57bd5504.json:101728:        "description": "MyTruv brings your full financial life into ChatGPT. Connect your accounts once, then ask anything: \"Can you do my full financial audit?\", \"What did I spend on dining last month?\" \"How much is hitting my account on payday?\" \"What's my net worth right now?\" Get instant, personalized answers grounded in your real data, with no spreadsheets, no app-switching, and no guesswork.\n\nWhat you can do with MyTruv in ChatGPT\nAsk about spending, income, bills, cash flow, and net worth in plain language. MyTruv pulls from all your linked accounts (checking, savings, credit cards, loans, and investments) and returns clear, contextual answers.\n\nTrack everything\nSee balances and activity across every account\nSearch transactions with smart categorization\nSurface trends, recurring charges, and spending patterns\n\nUnderstand your cash flow\nCompare money in vs. money out at any time horizon\nSee how bills and subscriptions shape your month\nSpot pressure points before they hit\n\nSee your income clearly\nBreak down gross vs. net pay, taxes, benefits, and retirement contributions\nReview pay statements and income trends over time\n\nTrack your net worth\nMonitor assets and liabilities in one view\nPull account-level details like credit limits, APR, and loan terms\n\nStay ahead of bills\nPreview upcoming charges\nReview payment history\nGet alerts for bills, unusual spending, and security events\n\nPrivate and secure\nBank-level 256-bit AES encryption\nRead-only access, so MyTruv can never move your money\nSOC 2 Type II certified\nPowered by Truv, trusted by 8M+ consumers\nNo ads. Subscription-supported.\n\nMyTruv makes personal finance practical, clear, and conversational, so you can spend intentionally, save confidently, and plan ahead, all without leaving ChatGPT.",
